# The Throne Room's Shadow Lord (battlefield 160) with a helper: the leader on Xarcabard at status 3; eve (it completed)
# enters too. Phase 1 killed: 32004 to both; the leader's finish spawns phase 2; eve's finds him up: nothing. Phase 2
# dies after two days: 32001 to both; the leader's finish: the title and the mission's (The New Frontier added: the
# engine's warning); eve's (canSkipCS 1): the title only.
lists ThroneRoom/_4l1/onTrigger ThroneRoom/_4l2/onTrigger ThroneRoom/onZoneIn/1 ThroneRoom/onEventUpdate/32000 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/32000 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/32001 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/32002 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/32003 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/32004 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/6 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/7
char zone=ThroneRoom pos=-108,-6,0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
warning: lua: addMission: overwriting current mission 65535 of log 3 with 0 -- the 32001 finish adds Zilart's The New Frontier while the char's Zilart log holds 65535 (no Zilart row yet): the engine's C++ ShowWarning, the mission is added
char eve zone=ThroneRoom pos=-108,-6,0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Bastok TheZeruhnReport completed
mission Bastok GeologicalSurvey completed
mission Bastok Fetichism completed
mission Bastok TheCrystalLine completed
mission Bastok WadingBeasts completed
mission Bastok TheEmissary completed
mission Bastok TheFourMusketeers completed
mission Bastok ToTheForsakenMines completed
mission Bastok Jeuno completed
mission Bastok Magicite completed
mission Bastok DarknessRising completed
mission Bastok XarcabardLandOfTruths current
eve: mission Bastok XarcabardLandOfTruths completed
login
missionstatus Bastok 3
eve: login
invite eve
eve: accept
trigger _4l1                            # the leader: the 32000 menu
update 32000 option=1                   # area 1: registered, entered
finish
eve: trigger _4l1                       # eve (completed): the menu
eve: update 32000 option=1              # entered
eve: finish
tick 2000
kill SHADOW_LORD_RANK_5_OFFSET          # phase 1 dead: 32004 to both
finish                                  # the leader's 32004: phase 2 spawned
eve: finish                             # eve's 32004: phase 2 up: nothing
tick 2000
kill SHADOW_LORD_RANK_5_OFFSET+3
tick 1000
wait jst=1
tick 1000
tick 1000
wait jst=1
tick 1000                               # the second day: phase 2 acts (an 028), HP 0
tick 1000                               # phase 2 dead: WON, 32001
tick 1000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
finish                                  # 32001: the leader: the title, the mission
eve: finish                             # 32001: eve: the title
